    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ki'mbulimbuli cha ndama cha zahabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'antu' aho ndi' v'awona ku'v'a Mose wakendela ku'su'v'a ku'fuma ku' lu'gu'lu', hohene v'ikumingaga ha mbele yamwa Aloni na ku'muwi'la ati', “Haya! Ku'v'ezezye mulungu u'go gu'ku'ku'londola. Ku'nguno mwenu'yo Mose u'yo waku'fumizye ku' nsi' ya Misili, ku'kamanya igambo i'lo lyamupandi'kile.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aloni wasu'v'yaga ati', “Muzule vipini vya zahabu mu matwi i'vyo v'azwalile v'aki' v'inywe na v'ana v'inywe v'a ki'gosya na v'a ki'ki'ma, mundetele.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene, v'antu' v'ose v'avisiniaga vipini vyose vya zahabu mu matwi gav'o, na ku'muletela Aloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe wavisolaga, wavisulaga, na wav'ezyaga ki'mbulimbuli cha wikole na ndama ngosya ku' ku'fyatu'la mu ki'seme. Nav'o v'aliiniaga mizwi zyav'o na ku'yomba ati', “Ev'e Izilaeli, u'yu' hu' mulungu winywe, u'yo wamufumizye ku' nsi' ya Misili.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Aloni wazyengaga ihozezyo ha mbele na ki'mbulimbuli cha ndama na ku'tangazya: “Igolo ku'lav'e na mwanya ku'nguno yamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wangalu'ke v'antu' v'ipunaga ndiyu', v'afumyaga vitaambo vya ku'zigya na vitaambo vya kwiswanania. V'antu' v'ikalaga ha nsi', v'alyaga na ku'nywa, hangi' v'i'maga na ku'v'ezya mwanya ku' lu'soko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose, “Sooka wangu', ku'nguno v'antu' v'ako av'o wav'afumizye ku' nsi' ya Misili, v'av'ezyaga mav'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'angu'haga muno ku'yi'leka nzi'la i'yo nafumizye ilagi'li'zyo v'ayi'londe. V'iv'ezezyaga ki'mbulimbuli cha ndama ngosya ya ku'fyatu'la mu ki'seme, nav'o v'akisengaga na v'aki'fumi'zyaga vitaambo na ku'yomba ati', ‘Ev'e Izilaeli, u'yu' hu' mulungu winywe, u'yo wamufumizye ku' nsi' ya Misili!’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Nawonaga v'antu' v'enav'a v'ali' na myoyo milambu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gi'si' ndeke ki'gele ki'sila channe ki'panki'le ku' wav'o, nanne mbazimangu'zye. Ali'vi ev'e nku'ku'v'ezya ku'v'a nsi' nhanya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi Mose wamwikongaga Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wakwe, na ku'yomba, “Ev'e Gu'ku' Mulungu, ku' ki' ki'sila chako ki'panki'le vidaki ku' v'antu' v'ako, av'o wav'afumizye ku' nsi' ya Misili ku' wu'kowozi wu'hanya na mukono gwa nguzu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lu' u'v'ezye vyeni'vyo, nhana V'amisili v'aku'yomba ati', ‘Wav'afumizye ku' ndaka mbi ki'gele akav'awu'lagi'le ku' ngu'lu' na ku'v'azimangu'zya mu welelo.’ Ev'e Gu'ku' Mulungu, tunia ki'sila chako ki'daki, na u'li'leke igambo lyeni'li' i'lo walomaga ku'li'v'ezya ku' v'antu' v'ako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'v'izu'ki'le v'akumba v'ako, Abalahamu, Isaka na Izilaeli, av'o walahi'la ku' moyo gwako mweni'ki'li', na ku'yomba, ‘Ndawingi'hye wu'v'yalwa winywe ki'ti' nsonda zya mu ilunde, na nsi' yeni'yi' i'yo nu'mulagana ndawu'pe wu'v'yalwa winywe wu'yi'saale nhananhana.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene, Gu'ku' Mulungu walekaga ku'v'av'ezezya v'antu' v'akwe igambo iv'i i'lo ndi' wayombaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Mose wasookaga ku'fuma ku' lu'gu'lu' na ago mav'ale av'i'li' ga mawe ga wu'sangi'lwa mu makono gakwe. Gav'age gatonilwe ku' ki'la lwandi', ku' mbele na ku' nnuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mav'ale genago ndi' muli'mo gwakwe Mulungu mweni'ki'li' na wu'tone wenu'wo ndi' watona Mulungu mweni'ki'li'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoswa aho wigwa ibu'bu' lya v'antu', wamuwi'laga Mose, “Ku'li' na ibu'bu' lya wu'lu'gu' ku' nkambi'.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi Mose wasu'v'yaga ati', “Li'kav'ile ibu'bu' lya ku'kinda ninga lya ku'kindwa, sumbwa li'li' ibu'bu' lya v'antu' av'o v'ali'wi'mba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose aho wegelaga ha nkambi' na ku'yi'wona yeni'yo ndama na v'antu' v'ali'negu'la, ki'sila chakwe chapanki'laga, nawe wagatami'zyaga mawe ago gali' mu makono gakwe na ku'gav'elagu'la mav'ale mav'ale henanho ha nsi'li'li' na lu'gu'lu'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene wayi'solaga yeni'yo ndama na ku'yi'tima mu moto, wayi'syaga mpaka yav'aga wu'fuma, na wawu'seselaga wu'fuma wenu'wo mu minzi' na ku'v'asingi'li'zya V'aizilaeli v'anywe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose wamuwu'zyaga Aloni, “V'aku'v'ezezyaga ki' v'antu' v'enav'a mpaka ku'v'ingi'zya mu wu'kenagu'zi wu'hanya vyeni'vyo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aloni wasu'v'yaga, “Nu'ku'lomba, ev'e gu'ku' wanne, ki'sila chako ku'du' ki'panki'le ku' wanne. U'v'amanyile v'antu' v'enav'a i'vyo v'ali' v'abu'hu ku'v'ezya wu'kenagu'zi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'eni'ki'li' v'ambwi'lile ati', ‘Ku'v'ezezye mulungu u'go gu'ku'ku'londola, ku'nguno mwenu'yo Mose u'yo waku'fumizye ku' nsi' ya Misili, ku'kamanya igambo i'lo lyamupandi'kile’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho nav'awi'laga, ‘Ki'la yu'mo u'yo azwalile ki'ntu' cha zahabu aki'zule.’ Hohene v'aviletaga, nanne navitagi'laga mu moto, haho yafumi'i'laga ndama yeni'yi'!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose aho ndi' wawona ku'v'a v'antu' v'enav'a v'akatala na ku'v'ezya ki'ti' i'vyo v'atogilwe, ku'nguno Aloni wakav'alekani'zya v'atale na kwiletela nsoni ku' v'anisi v'av'o, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Mose wi'maga ha wingi'li'lo wa nkambi' na ku'yomba, “Muntu' u'yo ali' ku' lwandi' lwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ize ku' lwandi' lwanne.” V'alawi v'ose v'ikumingaga haki'mo ha mbele yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe wav'awi'laga ati', “Gu'ku' Mulungu, Mulungu wa Izilaeli, ali'yomba i'vi: ‘Ki'la muntu' itunge lu'panga lwakwe mu muki'mbi'li', av'i'te ku'fuma wingi'li'lo wu'mo wa nkambi' mpaka wa wu'v'i'li' na ku'su'v'a, na ki'la yu'mo amuwu'lage mudu'gu'ye, munwaniye na muzenganwa wakwe.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho V'alawi v'av'ezyaga ki'ti' i'vyo Mose walagi'li'zyaga. Lu'siku' lwenu'lo ndi' v'awu'lagwa v'antu' ki'ti' vihu'mbi' vidatu'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Mose wayombaga ati', “Walelo mwasimi'kagwa ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu, ku'nguno mukisisikile ku'v'awu'laga v'ana v'inywe ninga v'adu'gu' v'inywe. Mulungu wamudosyaga lu'v'ango walelo yeni'yi'.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
