          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wangalu'ke Mose wav'awi'laga v'antu', “Mwav'ezizye wu'kenagu'zi wu'hanya! Gi'si' nu'ya ku' igu'lya ku' lu'gu'lu', ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. Hamo nku'kowola ku'v'ezya wu'swanano ku'nguno ya wu'kenagu'zi winywe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Mose wasu'v'aga ku'mwa Gu'ku' Mulungu na ku'muwi'la ati', “Nu'saya! V'antu' v'enav'a v'av'ezyaga wu'kenagu'zi wu'hanya. V'iv'ezezyaga mulungu gwa zahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi gi'si', nu'ku'lomba u'v'atondole wu'kenagu'zi wav'o. Mbe u'kav'atondolile, nu'kwikonga u'fute lina lyanne ku' ki'tabu chako i'cho u'v'atonile v'antu' v'ako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Gu'ku' Mulungu wasu'v'yaga ati', “Muntu' u'yo wakambezezya wu'kenagu'zi hu' mwene ndafute lina lyakwe mu ki'tabu channe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gi'si' u'kav'alondole v'antu' v'enav'a, u'ye mpaka ku' lwandi' u'lo naku'wi'lile. Lingaga, malaika wanne alaku'tongelele. Ninga vyeni'vyo, itungo aho li'lav'e lyafika ndav'ape lu'duko ku'nguno ya wu'kenagu'zi wav'o.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
